# Smoke-test sources generated by gen_smoketest.py at run time.
# run_smoketests.sh regenerates them from the installed headers before use, so
# none of them is tracked. A family's suite is named <family>_smoketest.c, so the
# pattern covers a family added later; trgeometry_test.c is the one generated
# suite whose name predates it.
/*_smoketest.c
/trgeometry_test.c

# Table fixtures exported from the pg_regress archives by
# tools/gen_test_csv.py. mobilitydb/test/<family>/data/load_*.sql.xz is the one
# copy of this data; the CSV form is written from it before the programs that
# read it run, so neither form can drift from the other.
/csv/

# Compiled smoke-test binaries and valgrind logs
/build/
__pycache__/
